# Files that must reach disk with LF whatever the checkout does.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true on Windows, `assets/icons/pack-icons.mjs` landed with
# CRLF and its own test stopped even parsing -- a green CI and a red local run
# for the same commit, which costs more to diagnose than it does to prevent.
# Scripts run by an interpreter that reads a shebang have the same problem.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
